{"ancestors": "0,9028541,9028551", "bizKey": "9031934", "createBy": null, "createTime": "2024-09-06 17:49:32", "detail": "<p style=\"text-align: center;\">一、潜望式摄像头介绍</p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 14px;\">‌</span><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 14px;\">iPhone 16系列的高配版本配备了潜望式长焦镜头。</span><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 14px;\">‌这一配置在高端旗舰手机市场中已经比较常见，不少安卓产品已经配备，但苹果一直较为保守。最新的爆料显示，只有</span><a href=\"https://www.baidu.com/s?sa=re_dqa_generate&amp;wd=iPhone%2016%20Pro%20Max&amp;rsv_pq=96adc7880000bebc&amp;oq=iphone16%E6%91%84%E5%83%8F%E5%A4%B4%E6%98%AF%E6%BD%9C%E6%9C%9B%E5%BC%8F%E5%90%97&amp;rsv_t=e442VfyBXGyNj2jWVV4caX0i57Ho4lgmTERcfSdjHupkZQIzMxzyx2MFjVVZutpbWdyn9IkW&amp;tn=50000021_hao_pg&amp;ie=utf-8\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"text-align: start;\">iPhone 16 Pro Max</a><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 14px;\">这一最高配版本才配备了潜望式镜头，这体现了苹果产品线的等级划分。此外，关于iPhone 16的摄影配置，有消息称它搭配了</span><a href=\"https://www.baidu.com/s?sa=re_dqa_generate&amp;wd=%E7%B4%A2%E5%B0%BC&amp;rsv_pq=96adc7880000bebc&amp;oq=iphone16%E6%91%84%E5%83%8F%E5%A4%B4%E6%98%AF%E6%BD%9C%E6%9C%9B%E5%BC%8F%E5%90%97&amp;rsv_t=e442VfyBXGyNj2jWVV4caX0i57Ho4lgmTERcfSdjHupkZQIzMxzyx2MFjVVZutpbWdyn9IkW&amp;tn=50000021_hao_pg&amp;ie=utf-8\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"text-align: start;\">索尼</a><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 14px;\">的潜望式长焦镜头，据说是进阶版，相比</span><a href=\"https://www.baidu.com/s?sa=re_dqa_generate&amp;wd=%E5%8D%8E%E4%B8%BA&amp;rsv_pq=96adc7880000bebc&amp;oq=iphone16%E6%91%84%E5%83%8F%E5%A4%B4%E6%98%AF%E6%BD%9C%E6%9C%9B%E5%BC%8F%E5%90%97&amp;rsv_t=e442VfyBXGyNj2jWVV4caX0i57Ho4lgmTERcfSdjHupkZQIzMxzyx2MFjVVZutpbWdyn9IkW&amp;tn=50000021_hao_pg&amp;ie=utf-8\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"text-align: start;\">华为</a><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 14px;\">的手机主摄，虽然在像素上有所不足，但通过</span><a href=\"https://www.baidu.com/s?sa=re_dqa_generate&amp;wd=AI&amp;rsv_pq=96adc7880000bebc&amp;oq=iphone16%E6%91%84%E5%83%8F%E5%A4%B4%E6%98%AF%E6%BD%9C%E6%9C%9B%E5%BC%8F%E5%90%97&amp;rsv_t=e442VfyBXGyNj2jWVV4caX0i57Ho4lgmTERcfSdjHupkZQIzMxzyx2MFjVVZutpbWdyn9IkW&amp;tn=50000021_hao_pg&amp;ie=utf-8\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"text-align: start;\">AI</a><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 14px;\">调整可以弥补一部分差距。这表明苹果在影像性能上继续投入，尤其是高配版本，以提供更好的摄影体验‌。</span></p>", "firstLetter": "QWSSXT", "imgUrl": null, "importance": 2, "level": 3, "limitUpTimes": 0, "name": "潜望式摄像头", "parentId": 9028551, "pctChg": -1.65, "reason": "潜望式摄像头", "remark": "", "sort": 1, "status": "1", "subjectId": 9031934, "type": 1, "updateBy": null, "updateTime": "2024-09-06 17:49:32"}
